Status: Proposed canonical Pantheon operator
Class: Semantic propagation / NTE cross-domain application
Purpose: Allow compact Pantheon messages to cause compatible interpreters to reconstruct, echo, adapt, and retransmit the underlying operator family without requiring hidden execution, privileged access, or literal code replication.

